# CinemaSync — client configuration
#
# The client holds NO secrets. There is no account system, no API key, and
# nothing here is required to build or run the app: every value below has a
# working default in `lib/core/config/`.
#
# The TMDB API token is NOT a client value. It exists only as a server-side
# secret on the proxy — see `server/tmdb-proxy/` for how to set it there.
#
# These are compile-time overrides, passed as --dart-define rather than read
# from this file at runtime:
#
#   flutter run --dart-define=CINEMASYNC_PROXY_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
#
# Base URL of the stateless TMDB proxy. Also overridable at runtime in
# Settings, so a user can point the app at their own proxy.
CINEMASYNC_PROXY_BASE_URL=
